View ViewTableSUPPLIEROFFER 'Offres (/*TITLEOBJ*/)' 'Offres (/*TITLEOBJ*/)'  255 255 255 _ 0 0 0 0 5 5 5 5 '[TRACELEVEL=(/*TRACELEVEL*/);TRACEFILE=;TOOLBAR=0;FLIPVERTICALLY=0;FLIPHORIZONTALLY=0;NATURESCALE=0;BESTFIT=1;SCROLLBAR=1;SHOWNAME=1;ZOOMOBJECT=;CURRENTPAGE=1;CLOSEEVENT=0;BKGROUNDCOLOR=(255 255 255);SCREENCOLOR=(255 255 255);PATHLINEWIDTH=9;PATHLINECOLOR=(0 0 0);PATHARROWWIDTH=15;PATHARROWCOLOR=(255 0 0);POEMSERVER=;MAPLOGFILE=;MATRIXCRITERION=Distance;MATRIXCOMPUTERADIUS=0.5;SPEEDKMHOUR=50;STRAIGHTDISTANCERATIO=1.4;SITEINTRADISTANCE=;MATRIXMAXCOMPUTEWIDTH=;NEIGHBOURHOOD=;MATRIXFILENAME=;MATRIXDIRECTORY=;GLOBALVARIABLE=0]'

Table tableSUPPLIEROFFER _ _ 0 0 2000 500 \
"[]" - \
"[TITLE=Offres (/*TITLEOBJ*/);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=10;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;LINESEPARATOR=\n;HEIGHT=30;BORDER=0;]"\
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=8;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[MARGIN=(10 0 10 0);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;] \
COLUMNFILL={(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255)};\
ALIGNTEXT={Left,Left,Left,Center,Center,Right,Right,Left}]"\
"[DATAOBJ=SUPPLIEROFFER;FILLCOLOR=LINERGB]"

Data SUPPLIEROFFER 'Offres (/*TITLEOBJ*/)' SUPPLIEROFFER HTTPSQL 0 '[FIND={IDSUPPLIER,NAMESUPPLIET,IDOFFER,DATEOFFER,DATEVALIDITY,TRANSPORTCOST,TRANSPORTTIME,COMMENTS}]'   [DOUBLECLICK=] \
"[8;(string,IDSUPPLIER,ID fournisseur,,15,,);(string,NAMESUPPLIET,Nom fournisseur,,15,,);(string,IDOFFER,ID offre,,10,,);(date,DATEOFFER,Date offre,,15,,YYYY-MM-DD|DD/MM/YYYY);(date,DATEVALIDITY,Date validation,,15,,YYYY-MM-DD|DD/MM/YYYY);(float,TRANSPORTCOST,Frais transport,,15,,);(float,TRANSPORTTIME,Temps transport,,15,,);(string,COMMENTS,Commentaire,,20,,);(color,LINERGB,(255 255 255),,13.0.0)]"\
"SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);QUERY=SELECT sof.idSupplier AS IDSUPPLIER,\
		 s.Name as NAMESUPPLIER,\
		 sof.IdOffer AS IDOFFER,\
		 sof.DateOffer as DATEOFFER,\
		 sof.DateValidity as DATEVALIDITY,\
		 format(sof.TransportCost,'0.00') AS TRANSPORTCOST,\
		 format(sof.TransportTime,'0') AS TRANSPORTTIME,\
		 sof.Comments AS COMMENTS,\
		 '(255 255 255)' AS LINERGB \
		 FROM SUPPLIEROFFER sof, SUPPLIER s \
		 WHERE s.id=sof.idSupplier\
		 and sof.(/*OWNEROBJ*/) in ((/*IDOBJ*/))\
		 Order BY sof.IdSupplier, sof.IdOffer"


Script EditOfferSupplier 'Editer' _ 1 'Editer' _ 'tableSUPPLIEROFFER' '( 0 0 0 0 )' _ _ _ '[COUNT=2;NETNCL=HTTP;SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);TIMEOUT=86400000;MESSAGE=0;CANCEL=0;SKIP=0;WAITCURSOR=1;]'  WinExec "[WAITTIME=600S;CONSOLE=0;DATAFMT=(SEP=',',RET=',',FMT=T,QUOT=SQUOT,HEADER=F,COUNT=F)]" '(/*POEMDATAEXEPATH*/)PoemData.exe' "(/*POEMDATACONFIG*/)?[PROFILE=(UID=(/*USERID*/),PWD=(/*PASSWORD*/),ACCESS=(/*PERMISSION*/));DSN=(DSN=(/*DBNAME*/),UID=(/*DBUSER*/),PWD=(/*DBPWD*/),OWNER=(/*DBOWNER*/));SERVER=(SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/),PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/),TIMEOUT=100000,UID=(/*USERID*/),PWD=(/*PASSWORD*/),PROXYNAME=,PROXYBYPASS=);]?OPEN TABLE SUPPLIEROFFER&IdSupplier in ({/*selected(tableSUPPLIEROFFER;1;(string,IDSUPPLIER))*/}) and IdOffer in ({/*selected(tableSUPPLIEROFFER;1;(string,IDOFFER))*/})" \
Reload _ _ _ _ 


Script TableProductForOffer  'Produits pour offre' _ 22 'Produits' _ 'tableSUPPLIEROFFER' '( 0 0 0 0 )' _ _ _ '[COUNT=1;NETNCL=HTTP;SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);TIMEOUT=86400000;MESSAGE=0;CANCEL=0;SKIP=0;WAITCURSOR=1;]'\
 Open '[DATAFMT=(SEP=COMMA,RET=COMMA,FMT=T,QUOT=SQUOT,HEADER=FALSE,COUNT=FALSE);FILE=(/*HTTPVIEW*/)TableProductForOffer.view]' _ _ \
"[POEMSERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);SERVERPORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);USERID=(/*USERID*/);CLUBID=(/*CLUBID*/);IDSUPPLIER={/*Selected(tableSUPPLIEROFFER;1;(string,IDSUPPLIER))*/};IDOFFER={/*Selected(tableSUPPLIEROFFER;1;(string,IDOFFER))*/};TITLEOBJ=du fournisseur {/*Selected(tableSUPPLIEROFFER;1;(string,IDSUPPLIER))*/};FAMILY='XXX']"

